        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world is in need of a warrior, mage, rogue, or any kind of hero that you can build-craft into existence. Pick a class, a weapon and off-hand equip, a passive skill, and your base stats to go slay some gobbos! Your adventure will likely be short-lived, so there will be plenty of chances to experiment!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>What to expect from this game:</u></strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's a roguelike</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A high amount of build customization before you start a run</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A high amount of customization during a run</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your build changes how your character feels to control, jump higher, more control, faster running, base stats make your character truly unique.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >9 classes to choose from, each with their own set of abilities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >8 weapons to equip, each with their own strengths and weaknesses</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 different defensive skills to pick to further customize how your hero deals with problems</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Countless passive skills to buy along the way.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A lot of enemy variety.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Different types of rooms that might be harder or easier due to your build, pick the best ones for maximized gold!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >NPCs who (usually) help you out</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>The effect of your character stats:</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Many factors  change how your character moves, your stats change how your character controls at a fundamental level.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892290/extras/11627cff92c9840111c92127fc7bef22.poster.avif?t=1761047830\" width=384 height=216 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892290/extras/11627cff92c9840111c92127fc7bef22.webm?t=1761047830\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892290/extras/11627cff92c9840111c92127fc7bef22.mp4?t=1761047830\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892290/extras/53bb7d00e449d03d9654eda25437d9d7.poster.avif?t=1761047830\" width=384 height=216 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892290/extras/53bb7d00e449d03d9654eda25437d9d7.webm?t=1761047830\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892290/extras/53bb7d00e449d03d9654eda25437d9d7.mp4?t=1761047830\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In addition to increased attack power, your Strength also improves your jumping, opening up paths that might be harder to reach for others.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892290/extras/a80a24eee4b8339fbf5dc4af0ea2fb45.poster.avif?t=1761047830\" width=384 height=216 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892290/extras/a80a24eee4b8339fbf5dc4af0ea2fb45.webm?t=1761047830\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892290/extras/a80a24eee4b8339fbf5dc4af0ea2fb45.mp4?t=1761047830\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892290/extras/7886ce9518f5f0e6b38633a67a0e0c6f.poster.avif?t=1761047830\" width=384 height=216 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892290/extras/7886ce9518f5f0e6b38633a67a0e0c6f.webm?t=1761047830\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892290/extras/7886ce9518f5f0e6b38633a67a0e0c6f.mp4?t=1761047830\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Agility affects your critical hit chance, but also makes you more maneuverable in the air, making it easier to weave through enemy attacks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892290/extras/e147420a55d2a88af8f9e26775332a53.poster.avif?t=1761047830\" width=384 height=216 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892290/extras/e147420a55d2a88af8f9e26775332a53.webm?t=1761047830\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892290/extras/e147420a55d2a88af8f9e26775332a53.mp4?t=1761047830\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892290/extras/6dda735a433b060462b65dba3708bc02.poster.avif?t=1761047830\" width=384 height=216 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892290/extras/6dda735a433b060462b65dba3708bc02.webm?t=1761047830\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892290/extras/6dda735a433b060462b65dba3708bc02.mp4?t=1761047830\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More attack speed is great, but your Speed stat also improves your running, truly opening up that option of building a &quot;dashing&quot; rogue!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892290/extras/6203882baa3a67e6aa7f6bd21c623e29.poster.avif?t=1761047830\" width=384 height=216 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892290/extras/6203882baa3a67e6aa7f6bd21c623e29.webm?t=1761047830\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892290/extras/6203882baa3a67e6aa7f6bd21c623e29.mp4?t=1761047830\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not that interested in physical abilities? No worries, mental stats are very powerful when using magic!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world is in need of a warrior, mage, rogue, or any kind of hero that you can build-craft into existence. Pick a class, a weapon and off-hand equip, a passive skill, and your base stats to go slay some gobbos! Your adventure will likely be short-lived, so there will be plenty of chances to experiment!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>What to expect from this game:</u></strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's a roguelike</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A high amount of build customization before you start a run</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A high amount of customization during a run</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your build changes how your character feels to control, jump higher, more control, faster running, base stats make your character truly unique.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >9 classes to choose from, each with their own set of abilities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >8 weapons to equip, each with their own strengths and weaknesses</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 different defensive skills to pick to further customize how your hero deals with problems</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Countless passive skills to buy along the way.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A lot of enemy variety.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Different types of rooms that might be harder or easier due to your build, pick the best ones for maximized gold!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >NPCs who (usually) help you out</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>The effect of your character stats:</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Many factors  change how your character moves, your stats change how your character controls at a fundamental level.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892290/extras/11627cff92c9840111c92127fc7bef22.poster.avif?t=1761047830\" width=384 height=216 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892290/extras/11627cff92c9840111c92127fc7bef22.webm?t=1761047830\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892290/extras/11627cff92c9840111c92127fc7bef22.mp4?t=1761047830\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892290/extras/53bb7d00e449d03d9654eda25437d9d7.poster.avif?t=1761047830\" width=384 height=216 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892290/extras/53bb7d00e449d03d9654eda25437d9d7.webm?t=1761047830\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892290/extras/53bb7d00e449d03d9654eda25437d9d7.mp4?t=1761047830\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In addition to increased attack power, your Strength also improves your jumping, opening up paths that might be harder to reach for others.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892290/extras/a80a24eee4b8339fbf5dc4af0ea2fb45.poster.avif?t=1761047830\" width=384 height=216 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892290/extras/a80a24eee4b8339fbf5dc4af0ea2fb45.webm?t=1761047830\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892290/extras/a80a24eee4b8339fbf5dc4af0ea2fb45.mp4?t=1761047830\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892290/extras/7886ce9518f5f0e6b38633a67a0e0c6f.poster.avif?t=1761047830\" width=384 height=216 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892290/extras/7886ce9518f5f0e6b38633a67a0e0c6f.webm?t=1761047830\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892290/extras/7886ce9518f5f0e6b38633a67a0e0c6f.mp4?t=1761047830\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Agility affects your critical hit chance, but also makes you more maneuverable in the air, making it easier to weave through enemy attacks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892290/extras/e147420a55d2a88af8f9e26775332a53.poster.avif?t=1761047830\" width=384 height=216 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892290/extras/e147420a55d2a88af8f9e26775332a53.webm?t=1761047830\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892290/extras/e147420a55d2a88af8f9e26775332a53.mp4?t=1761047830\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892290/extras/6dda735a433b060462b65dba3708bc02.poster.avif?t=1761047830\" width=384 height=216 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892290/extras/6dda735a433b060462b65dba3708bc02.webm?t=1761047830\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892290/extras/6dda735a433b060462b65dba3708bc02.mp4?t=1761047830\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More attack speed is great, but your Speed stat also improves your running, truly opening up that option of building a &quot;dashing&quot; rogue!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892290/extras/6203882baa3a67e6aa7f6bd21c623e29.poster.avif?t=1761047830\" width=384 height=216 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892290/extras/6203882baa3a67e6aa7f6bd21c623e29.webm?t=1761047830\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3892290/extras/6203882baa3a67e6aa7f6bd21c623e29.mp4?t=1761047830\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not that interested in physical abilities? No worries, mental stats are very powerful when using magic!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
